From 85e0e2ed043534b4f37a1511e853f517131f76bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 08:40:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Improve SEO/AEO discoverability and page speed

- Fix sitemap.xml generation: CORE_PAGES was missing Investor Corner,
  Calculator, Projects, Search, Request, and all 5 buying/rental/lelong
  guide articles, so Google was never told these indexed, fully
  schema'd pages existed. Also add real per-file <lastmod> dates
  (from git history) instead of none at all.
- Compress oversized hero/card images to WebP (banner, calculator,
  projects, simple, auction, under: ~11MB -> ~700KB combined, 90%+
  smaller) to fix the homepage's Largest Contentful Paint. Update all
  references accordingly.
- Remove 3 orphaned, unlinked, stale legacy pages (jual.html,
  sewa.html, area.html) that weren't in the sitemap or nav and one had
  a broken canonical pointing to a nonexistent route.
- Remove 2 duplicate files (investorcorner.html, "index - Copy.html")
  that already self-canonicalized to their real counterparts.
